%% UC3 data-access sequence. Author: Thin Lei Sandi (523K0075).
sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant View as Voucher Workspace
    participant HTTP as Voucher HTTP Controller
    participant Service as Voucher Service
    participant Repo as Voucher Repository
    participant DB as SQLite
    Admin->>View: Open voucher management or select voucher
    View->>HTTP: GET vouchers or voucher details with actor context
    HTTP->>Service: list or details with username
    Service->>Repo: Resolve administrator permission
    Repo->>DB: SELECT user with admin role
    alt Access denied
        Service-->>HTTP: Access denied
        HTTP-->>View: 403 without voucher data
    else Administrator authorized
        Service->>Repo: Read vouchers and optional change history
        Repo->>DB: SELECT vouchers and voucher audit
        Service-->>HTTP: Fields and current allowed actions
        HTTP-->>View: List or details
    end
    Admin->>View: Save create or edit, or confirm archive
    View->>HTTP: POST create, PUT edit, or POST confirmed archive
    HTTP->>Service: save or archive with actor and input
    Service->>Repo: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
    Repo->>DB: Begin write transaction
    Service->>Repo: Recheck administrator and current voucher
    Repo->>DB: SELECT current role and voucher state
    Service->>Repo: Check code uniqueness and eligible hub
    Repo->>DB: SELECT matching code and hubs
    alt Permission, input or lifecycle check fails
        Service->>Repo: ROLLBACK
        Repo->>DB: Roll back transaction
        Service-->>HTTP: Error and applicable field messages
        HTTP-->>View: 403, 404, 409 or 422 without changes
    else Valid change
        Service->>Repo: Insert voucher, update fields or set archived timestamp
        Repo->>DB: INSERT or UPDATE vouchers
        Service->>Repo: Audit administrator, action and timestamp
        Repo->>DB: INSERT voucher audit
        alt Storage or audit write fails
            Service->>Repo: ROLLBACK
            Repo->>DB: Restore voucher and audit together
            HTTP-->>View: 500 with retry message
        else Writes succeed
            Service->>Repo: COMMIT
            Repo->>DB: Commit voucher and audit
            HTTP-->>View: Saved details and current status
            View-->>Admin: Display result
        end
    end
    participant Checkout as UC1 Checkout
    Checkout->>DB: Read current voucher for quote and submission
    DB-->>Checkout: Discount, dates, minimum, hub and archive flag
    Checkout->>Checkout: Enforce current eligibility and calculate discount
